Package: com.zeshan.phoneaura
Name: PhoneAura
Version: 0.4.11
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: PhoneAura is a free, modern redesign of the iOS 16 Phone app. Version 0.4.11 keeps a fixed saved-number suggestion area above the keypad so the digits never shift while typing. Matching contacts appear in the reserved card; when no saved number matches, it displays Number not saved. It also includes the native contact menu, clipboard Paste, custom Favorites, smart Recents filters, call details, Contacts, swipe-to-delete controls, haptics and fluid animations. Built for rootless jailbreaks.
Depiction: https://zeshan0727.github.io/depictions/phoneaura.html
Homepage: https://zeshan0727.github.io/
Maintainer: Next Solution
Author: Next Solution
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
